OL,4,G1300FClassical Live
OL,5,     GAlfred Brendel plays Beethoven's
OL,6,     G4th Piano Concerto in an archive
OL,7,     Grecording from Munich, plus
OL,8,     GElgar's Enigma Variations from
OL,9,     Gthe BBC National Orchestra of
OL,10,     GWales.
OL,11,G1600FComposer of the Week: Copland
OL,12,     GDonald Macleod examines Copland's
OL,13,     Gclosest collaborations - and his
OL,14,     Gpolitical controversies.
OL,15,G1700FIn Tune
OL,16,     GMezzo-soprano Katie Bray is
OL,17,     Gjoined by pianist Will Van to
OL,18,     Gperform from and talk about her
OL,19,     Gnew Kurt Weill album as well as
OL,20,     Gviolin & piano duo Elena Urioste
OL,21,     G& Tom Poster.
